What is AWS CloudTrail?🤔

👉AWS CloudTrail is a logging and monitoring service.

👉It records actions and activities performed inside your AWS account.

♦️What Does CloudTrail Track?

CloudTrail logs things like:
• User logins
• API calls
• Resource changes
• Account activity

♦️Why CloudTrail is Important 🔐

CloudTrail improves:
• Visibility
• Monitoring
• Security investigations

If suspicious activity happens, CloudTrail helps track it.

♦️Real Example
If someone deletes an S3 bucket or changes IAM permissions:
CloudTrail records the event.
This helps security teams investigate incidents.

♦️Security Benefit 🛡️

CloudTrail is essential for:
• Auditing
• Compliance
• Detecting unauthorized activity
Logging is a major part of cloud security.
